Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether a diagonal positive definite $Y$ with $Y \leq X$ exists, where $X$ solves the CARE $AX + XA^T - Xbb^TX + Q = 0$ with $A$ Hurwitz diagonal, $Q \succ 0$, $\|b\|_2 \leq \beta$.

